{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RouteContextGuide"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftRouting"}],"title":"Route Context","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RouteContext"},{"type":"text","text":" enables communication from child routes back to parent routes. Use it to pass selection results, form data, or completion signals up the navigation hierarchy."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"What is RouteContext?","anchor":"What-is-RouteContext","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"code":"RouteContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is any type conforming to "},{"code":"Hashable & Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It acts as a message that can be sent from a child route and received by any ancestor route that registered an observer."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct UserSelectionContext: RouteContext {","    let selectedUser: User","}","","struct FormCompletionContext: RouteContext {","    let formData: FormData","    let success: Bool","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Registering Context Observers","anchor":"Registering-Context-Observers","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Using the View Modifier","anchor":"Using-the-View-Modifier","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The simplest way to observe contexts is with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"routerContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct ParentView: View {","    @State private var selectedUser: User?","    ","    var body: some View {","        ContentView()","            .routerContext(UserSelectionContext.self) { context in","                selectedUser = context.selectedUser","            }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Using Router Directly","anchor":"Using-Router-Directly","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For ViewModel-driven architectures, register observers via "},{"code":"any RouterModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@MainActor","final class ParentViewModel: ObservableObject {","    private let router: any RouterModel","","    init(router: any RouterModel) {","        self.router = router","    }","","    func startObservingContext() {","        router.add(context: UserSelectionContext.self) { [weak self] context in","            self?.selectedUser = context.selectedUser","        }","    }","","    func stopObservingContext() {","        router.remove(context: UserSelectionContext.self)","    }","","    deinit {","        stopObservingContext()","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In views, prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".routerContext(...)"},{"type":"text","text":" for simple cases."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"any RouterModel"},{"type":"text","text":" in ViewModels when context handling belongs to presentation\/business logic."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning: Use weak captures for class references (for example view models) to prevent retain cycles."}]}],"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside"},{"text":"Sending Context","anchor":"Sending-Context","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"From a child route, send context using ","type":"text"},{"code":"context(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"terminate(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"context(_:) - Send Without Navigation","anchor":"context-Send-Without-Navigation","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sends the context to all observers without affecting navigation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct UserPickerView: View {","    @Environment(\\.router) private var router","    let users: [User]","    ","    var body: some View {","        List(users) { user in","            Button(user.name) {","                \/\/ Send context but stay on this screen","                router.context(UserSelectionContext(selectedUser: user))","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"terminate(_:) - Send and Complete Navigation","anchor":"terminate-Send-and-Complete-Navigation","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sends the context, then completes navigation based on router state:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct UserPickerView: View {","    @Environment(\\.router) private var router","    let users: [User]","    ","    var body: some View {","        List(users) { user in","            Button(user.name) {","                \/\/ Send context and complete the current flow","                router.terminate(UserSelectionContext(selectedUser: user))","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"terminate(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" will:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute all matching context observers"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a matching local context anchor is found, pop back to that point in the current stack"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise, close the modal if the router is presented"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise, go back one step"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"text":"Context Hierarchy","anchor":"Context-Hierarchy","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Contexts propagate up through the entire router hierarchy:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["App Router","    └── Tab Router","            └── Home Router (observer registered here)","                    └── List Router","                            └── Detail Router (context sent from here)"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When context is sent from Detail Router, it reaches the observer in Home Router."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Removing Observers","anchor":"Removing-Observers","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Observers are automatically removed when their route is popped. You can also remove them manually:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["router.remove(context: UserSelectionContext.self)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remove(context:)"},{"type":"text","text":" removes observers for that context type "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"only on the current route","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Common Patterns","anchor":"Common-Patterns","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"text":"Selection Flow","anchor":"Selection-Flow","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ Parent: Start selection","router.push(HomeRoute.userPicker)","","\/\/ Parent: Receive selection",".routerContext(UserSelectionContext.self) { context in","    selectedUser = context.selectedUser","}","","\/\/ Child: Complete selection","router.terminate(UserSelectionContext(selectedUser: user))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Form Completion","anchor":"Form-Completion","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"code":["\/\/ Parent",".routerContext(FormCompletionContext.self) { context in","    if context.success {","        showSuccessMessage()","    }","}","","\/\/ Child (form view)","func submitForm() async {","    let success = await api.submit(formData)","    router.terminate(FormCompletionContext(formData: formData, success: success))","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Multi-Step Wizard","anchor":"Multi-Step-Wizard","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"code":["struct WizardContext: RouteContext {","    let step: Int","    let data: WizardData","}","","\/\/ Each step sends progress","router.context(WizardContext(step: currentStep, data: collectedData))","","\/\/ Final step terminates","router.terminate(WizardContext(step: finalStep, data: completeData))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Memory Management","anchor":"Memory-Management","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Context closures can cause retain cycles. Always use weak references:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ ✅ Correct","router.add(context: MyContext.self) { [weak self] context in","    self?.handleContext(context)","}","","\/\/ ✅ Correct with view model",".routerContext(MyContext.self) { [weak viewModel] context in","    viewModel?.process(context)","}","","\/\/ ❌ Wrong for class references - causes retain cycle","router.add(context: MyContext.self) { context in","    self.handleContext(context)  \/\/ Strong reference to self","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting"],["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/FAQ"],["doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting","doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/Troubleshooting"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Learn how to pass data between routes using RouteContext.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/routecontextguide"]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiftRouting/documentation/SwiftRouting/FAQ":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/FAQ","role":"collectionGroup","title":"FAQ","url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/faq","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Answers to common questions about SwiftRouting usage and design decisions.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftRouting/documentation/SwiftRouting/Troubleshooting":{"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/Troubleshooting","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Diagnose and fix common issues encountered when using SwiftRouting."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/troubleshooting","title":"Troubleshooting"},"doc://SwiftRouting/documentation/SwiftRouting":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting","type":"topic","title":"SwiftRouting","abstract":[{"text":"A lightweight, type-safe navigation framework built on top of NavigationStack for SwiftUI.","type":"text"}]},"doc://SwiftRouting/documentation/SwiftRouting/RouteContext":{"fragments":[{"text":"typealias","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RouteContext","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/routecontext","abstract":[{"text":"A type that can be used to pass data between routes and trigger navigation flow completions.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RouteContext","title":"RouteContext","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RouteContext","kind":"identifier"}]}}}